
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.RequestDisplayName(AvatarID: uuid): uuid`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`key llRequestDisplayName(key AvatarID);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Requests the <b><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Display_Names" target="_blank">Display Name</a></b> of the agent identified by <b>id</b>. When the Display Name is available the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event will be raised. The agent identified by <b>id</b> does not need to be in the same region or online at the time of the request.</p>
  <p>Returns the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Key/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a>) that is used to identify the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event when it is raised.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>AvatarID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/id" target="_blank">id</a></td>
          <td>avatar <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>avatar</li>
        <li>dataserver</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">361</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If the request fails for any reason, there will be no error notice or dataserver event. You may use a timer to check for stale requests.</li>
    <li><p>If you merely wish to show the agent display name in the viewer window, it may be more straightforward to use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_URI_Name_Space" target="_blank">Viewer URI Name Space</a> and avoid a dataserver event, e.g.:</p>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
llSay(0, "secondlife:///app/agent/" + (string)id + "/displayname");
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local owner_key = NULL_KEY
local owner_name_query = NULL_KEY
local owner_display_name = ""

local function main()
    owner_key = ll.GetOwner()
    owner_name_query = ll.RequestDisplayName(owner_key)
end
function LLEvents.dataserver(queryid, data)
    if owner_name_query == queryid then
        owner_display_name = data
        ll.Say(0, "The display name of the owner of this script : " .. owner_display_name)
    end
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`key owner_key;
key owner_name_query;
string owner_display_name;

default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        owner_key = llGetOwner();
        owner_name_query = llRequestDisplayName(owner_key);
    }
    dataserver(key queryid, string data)
    {
        if ( owner_name_query == queryid )
        {
            owner_display_name = data;
            llSay(0, "The display name of the owner of this script : " + owner_display_name );
        }
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
